<title>USA: Concorde Career Colleges Inc Q1 EPS flat.</title>
<headline>Concorde Career Colleges Inc Q1 EPS flat.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended March 31, 1997 and 1996</p>
<p>						 1997		   1996</p>
<p> Revenues			     $9,431,000	  $11,032,000</p>
<p> Total operating expenses	  8,907,000	   10,031,000</p>
<p> Operating income			524,000	    1,001,000</p>
<p> Net income				505,000		548,000</p>
<p> Primary earnings per share		.06		    .06</p>
<p> Weighted average common share   8,537,000	    7,645,000</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 net income before $29,000 in preferred dividends vs $60,000 in Q1 1996.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
